# ==============================================================================
# CLEAN AI PLATFORM — Environment Overview (root .env.example)
# ==============================================================================
# There is NO root .env. Each app loads its own file:
#
#   backend/.env          ← copy from backend/.env.example  (server secrets)
#   frontend/.env.local   ← copy from frontend/.env.example (NEXT_PUBLIC_* only)
#
# On Vercel, set the BACKEND variables in Project → Settings → Environment
# Variables (they are shared across the frontend/backend services):
#
#   Required:  DATABASE_URL, DIRECT_URL, JWT_SECRET, JWT_REFRESH_SECRET,
#              and GEMINI_API_KEY or GROQ_API_KEY (at least one)
#   Optional:  CLOUDINARY_*, REDIS_URL, SMTP_*, RAZORPAY_*, FIREBASE_*,
#              CORS_ORIGIN / FRONTEND_URL / SOCKET_CORS_ORIGIN
#   Frontend:  NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY
#              (leave NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL / _SOCKET_URL / _APP_URL unset —
#               same-origin routing is automatic in the single-project setup)
#
# Full reference: docs/ENV_VARIABLES.md
# Company migration runbook: docs/COMPANY_TRANSFER.md
# ==============================================================================
